{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And it came.</b> The angel, between the camp of Egypt and the camp of Israel, to guide the two pillars." "<b>And the cloud and the darkness were.</b> The darkness of night was together with the cloud, behind Israel and behind the pillar of fire." "<b>And it lit up the night.</b> The angel in the pillar of fire — for through it He removed the darkness of night, and there was no cloud separating them from the illuminating fire, as there was on Egypt's side." "<b>And the one did not come near the other.</b> For those who walk in darkness walk slowly of necessity, for they do not know what they may stumble over."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:28.632925642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}